{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"Reconciler read/check path isolation","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","Jira Cloud","Jira Data Center","SecretStr","SecretBytes","reconcile-check","tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_operation_bindings.py"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read path","immutable settings","ambient mutation","backend construction","secrets","configuration authority"],"propositions":["Reconciler read/check paths currently call load_config() and inspect environment/cwd, allowing ambient mutations to change read scope mid-operation or override supplied config.","Jira backends are constructed without immutable bindings, permitting their properties to reload from environment and alter project/query scope, TLS, timeouts, or authentication mid-operation.","Tracker layout, Git ref paths, and Bridge projections are hard-coded rather than derived from supplied ReconcilerSettings, preventing custom tracker directory/branch/remote from being authoritative.","After environment or file mutation between operations, a backend composed from ambient state observes the new settings rather than retaining the original supplied configuration.","Unselected Jira providers (Cloud or Data Center) may be constructed even when unused, creating unnecessary auth/TLS surface and potential cross-provider fallback.","Secrets embedded in backend repr, logs, cache keys, or wire boundaries leak sensitive auth material during diagnostics and troubleshooting."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787886162646735001,"uuid":"2fb8711e-2743-43ed-bd04-d9157b9dd00d"}